{"book":19,"chapter":93,"context":{"chapter":93,"title":"The LORD Reigns Above the Floods","summary":"The LORD reigns, robed in majesty; the world is firm, his throne is ancient, and he is mightier than the roaring seas. His decrees stand and holiness fits his house.","background":"No title. The first of a group of psalms celebrating God as King (93, 95–99), several of which open 'The LORD reigneth.' The rising floods picture chaotic forces that threaten order; God is above them. The Mishnah lists it as the Levites' psalm for the sixth day.","customs":[],"watchFor":["The step-like repetition: 'The floods have lifted up... the floods have lifted up' (v. 3).","Just five verses, ending on God's word and holiness (v. 5)."],"connections":["Psalms 97:1","Psalms 29:10","Exodus 15:18","Revelation 19:6"]},"verses":{"1":{"w":[["יְהוָה","yahweh","H3068","HNpt","Yahweh"],["מָלָךְ","malokh","H4427","HVqp3ms","he reigns"],["גֵּאוּת","ge'ut","H1348","HNcfsa","majesty"],["לָבֵשׁ","lavesh","H3847","HVqp3ms","he is clothed"],["לָבֵשׁ","lavesh","H3847","HVqp3ms","he is clothed"],["יְהוָה","yahweh","H3068","HNpt","Yahweh"],["עֹז","'oz","H5797","HNcmsa","strength"],["הִתְאַזָּר","hit'azar","H247","HVtp3ms","he has girded himself"],["אַף","'af-","H637","HTj","also"],["תִּכּוֹן","tikon","H3559","HVNi3fs","it is established"],["תֵּבֵל","tevel","H8398","HNcfsa","[the] world"],["בַּל","bal-","H1077","HTn","not"],["תִּמּוֹט","timot","H4131","HVNi3fs","it will be shaken"]],"x":[[19096010,19096010,20],[13029012,13029012,14],[19099001,19099001,13],[66019006,66019006,13],[19103019,19103019,11],[19065006,19065006,9],[19018032,19018032,8],[19059013,19059013,8],[19097001,19097001,8],[19104001,19104002,8]],"xn":27},"2":{"w":[["נָכוֹן","nakhon","H3559","HVNrmsa","[has been] established"],["כִּסְאֲךָ","kis'akha","H3678","HNcmsc/Sp2ms","throne your"],["מֵאָז","me'az","H227","HR/D","from then"],["מֵעוֹלָם","me'olam","H5769","HR/Ncmsa","[are] from long ago"],["אָתָּה","'atah","H859","HPp2ms","you"]],"x":[